0.6.4  F  utf8DecodeAt     (-> String Int Int) -> (-> String Int (Option Int)): -1 was "no code point begins here"
0.6.4  F  utf8CharAt       (-> String Int Int) -> (-> String Int (Option Int)): -1 was "past the end"
0.6.4  F  netPollSignalAt  (-> Int Int Int Int Int) -> (-> Int Int Int Int (Option Int)): -1 was "not a signal event"

