# the caller went on to dereference. A stored 0 and an empty vector
# arrived at the caller identically before, which is the same
# indistinguishability the `vecGet` block below records. Guard with
# `vecLen` before popping; the trap is RECOVERABLE, so `__axiom_recover`
# answers 77 rather than exiting.
